  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ya se está interviniendo este tradicional espacio de encuentro familiar con una inversión de $81 millones, destinada a la reposición de los juegos infantiles.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">La obra es ejecutada por Comercializadora y Distribuidora LPJ Limitada, con supervisión técnica de la Dirección de Obras Municipales.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✨\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tf4/1/16/2728.png\"/> Una importante mejora que permitirá contar con un espacio más moderno, seguro y atractivo para los niños, niñas y familias de Maullín Urbano y puntualmente de ese sector periférico de Maullin .</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">FUENTE MUNIMAULLIN.CL</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-77 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13920\" data-id=\"13920\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/5jwz9u6b6rr6ife/miramar_02_1024x682_vwndxzsd0j.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13919\" data-id=\"13919\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/488qtf7sa5yskfm/miramar_03_1024x682_lvcyn7hk6j.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13917\" data-id=\"13917\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/1puaswo863sb07d/miramar_04_1024x682_adi7yr1hoe.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13921\" data-id=\"13921\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/x89pb4favxobnth/miramar_05_1024x682_x9nuo7448z.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13918\" data-id=\"13918\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/7ak5p5eayrpaeym/miramar_06_1024x682_lpjjaqfw9z.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n</figure>"
